# Datainitial Contact Forms

A complete **Headless WordPress + React Contact Form System** built for **Datainitial** that connects a custom WordPress plugin backend with a modern React frontend.

This project allows your React website to submit contact inquiries directly into WordPress using REST API endpoints, while also providing an admin dashboard for managing submissions.

---

# 🌐 Live Project
### Website:
https://datanitial.com

---

# 📌 Project Purpose

This system was developed to:

- Capture leads from React frontend
- Store inquiries inside WordPress database
- Manage submissions from WordPress Admin
- Export leads as CSV
- Support Headless WordPress architecture
- Integrate with Contact Form 7 where required

